==== Modification Notice (Frontend/Backend Separation Fork) ====

This repository is a modified version of new-api. The modifications consist of
separating the web console into a standalone repository and building the backend
as a pure API server by default:

  - The React frontend source has been moved out of this repository into a
    separate frontend project (new-api-web).
  - The backend builds as a pure API binary by default (build tag
    !embed_frontend) and serves no static files.
    The monolith remains available through the embed_frontend build tag.
  - New deployment environment variables were added to support separated
    deployments: FRONTEND_BASE_URL, API_BASE_URL, CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS,
    SESSION_COOKIE_SECURE and SESSION_COOKIE_TRUSTED_URL.
  - The Docker Compose configuration builds the image from the local source
    tree instead of pulling the upstream published image.

The modified version must not misrepresent the origin of the software and must
